-- GENERATED by scripts/release/generate_kanel_bookings_rollback.py from replayed
-- snapshots (S105 vs S109). Do not hand-edit; regenerate. Verified by
-- scripts/release/verify_kanel_bookings_rollback.sh.
--
-- OWNER-APPROVED USE ONLY. Safe to run from any partial state (S106..S109): every
-- statement is idempotent and the whole script is one transaction.
--
-- Restores to the exact S105 definitions: atlas_private.booking_find_contiguous_tables, public.atlas_bookings_assign.
-- Removes: the lifecycle trigger and the 15 functions S106–S109 added
-- (the public guest-booking RPCs, the staff inbox RPCs and their helpers).
-- Restores the S105 values of booking_settings.max_party_online / turnaround_minutes
-- and the Bar's circular_adjacency (production confirmed 30 / 0 before release;
-- if the pre-release backup recorded different values, use those instead).
--
-- Left in place on purpose (inert once the functions above are gone, data kept):
--   tables  atlas_private.booking_email_outbox, atlas_private.booking_notifications, atlas_private.booking_public_rate
--   columns atlas_private.booking_areas(online_bookable); atlas_private.booking_settings(booking_email_from, public_hold_minutes, public_online_enabled); atlas_private.booking_tables(segment); atlas_private.reservations(public_token)
